{"resourceId": "gid://shopify/OnlineStoreThemeJsonTemplate/product.rz?theme_id=210260099402", "translations": [{"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ingredientes.i2.titulo:6kszjcmu7wkv", "value": "Huile de menthe", "translatableContentDigest": "ffcf847e341b924a455a8a1eb81bcc882b0ef9145bb6150843059cf17c143f7c"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ingredientes.i2.titulo:6kszjcmu7wkv", "value": "Óleo de hortelã-pimenta", "translatableContentDigest": "ffcf847e341b924a455a8a1eb81bcc882b0ef9145bb6150843059cf17c143f7c"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ingredientes.i2.texto:2u4jt3jmhxfnm", "value": "Apporte cette sensation de fraîcheur que vous sentirez dès le premier massage.", "translatableContentDigest": "8179733b2ae5f937607a4332d37a9bea49a53bdf1ac0677caf860eb113ae0400"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ingredientes.i2.texto:2u4jt3jmhxfnm", "value": "Traz aquela sensação de frescura que vai notar desde a primeira massagem.", "translatableContentDigest": "8179733b2ae5f937607a4332d37a9bea49a53bdf1ac0677caf860eb113ae0400"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ingredientes.i3.titulo:2yhuuf17mcpri", "value": "Huiles végétales", "translatableContentDigest": "61609b393d4a9503cdc6d4e049c58a8f98799cada507f96c44f762a20fb71fd1"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ingredientes.i3.titulo:2yhuuf17mcpri", "value": "Óleos vegetais", "translatableContentDigest": "61609b393d4a9503cdc6d4e049c58a8f98799cada507f96c44f762a20fb71fd1"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ingredientes.i3.texto:wyeti52im7qb", "value": "Une base légère qui prend soin de la racine et laisse les cheveux doux et lumineux.", "translatableContentDigest": "c4fe3c584bd725c92be41f060ee9f3c7279faac86937a5ea525721f9e71b8f46"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ingredientes.i3.texto:wyeti52im7qb", "value": "Uma base leve que cuida da raiz e deixa o cabelo suave e luminoso.", "translatableContentDigest": "c4fe3c584bd725c92be41f060ee9f3c7279faac86937a5ea525721f9e71b8f46"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ingredientes.i4.titulo:2srz5fx6h9wa1", "value": "Des cheveux plus forts", "translatableContentDigest": "e4d94e563c16a17901c1c78912595384eb854b6e407903b3b2cf5a433c7ab8b6"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ingredientes.i4.titulo:2srz5fx6h9wa1", "value": "Cabelo mais forte", "translatableContentDigest": "e4d94e563c16a17901c1c78912595384eb854b6e407903b3b2cf5a433c7ab8b6"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ingredientes.i4.texto:1z06rxq4l8tdw", "value": "Plus de résistance pour les cheveux secs ou cassants, et un éclat qui se voit.", "translatableContentDigest": "beacdbda171ff96f2e0bb955bedfbfbd8ae8ad2b7db7c29ecd9edd7166223fab"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ingredientes.i4.texto:1z06rxq4l8tdw", "value": "Mais resistência para o cabelo seco ou quebradiço, e um brilho que se nota.", "translatableContentDigest": "beacdbda171ff96f2e0bb955bedfbfbd8ae8ad2b7db7c29ecd9edd7166223fab"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.eyebrow:sbuqrw54zuks", "value": "Votre rituel", "translatableContentDigest": "df2545f263513816fd46ca53e1848114b1d78fc27df5936a7de2be4dc5bdf139"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.eyebrow:sbuqrw54zuks", "value": "O seu ritual", "translatableContentDigest": "df2545f263513816fd46ca53e1848114b1d78fc27df5936a7de2be4dc5bdf139"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.titulo:37iy8g2ubelia", "value": "Trois gestes, <em>quinze</em> minutes", "translatableContentDigest": "7b801aae241d96657451e0ab5836e8691ecfdfd42b5f2884647247f56dbc6505"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.titulo:37iy8g2ubelia", "value": "Três gestos, <em>quinze</em> minutos", "translatableContentDigest": "7b801aae241d96657451e0ab5836e8691ecfdfd42b5f2884647247f56dbc6505"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.texto:g8p7zhj19gz3", "value": "Faites-en votre petit moment de bien-être avant le shampooing.", "translatableContentDigest": "8d37311ffbab3011ef66d7f53a7c6e0ccb88dfd90ef8d5cb9f45735a647bad2a"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.texto:g8p7zhj19gz3", "value": "Transforme-o no seu pequeno momento de autocuidado antes da lavagem.", "translatableContentDigest": "8d37311ffbab3011ef66d7f53a7c6e0ccb88dfd90ef8d5cb9f45735a647bad2a"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p1.titulo:3w2ux0iv4aazc", "value": "Appliquez quelques gouttes", "translatableContentDigest": "360916496b8de32704d791aa905d7be66e65b27170d62c6ff43065a33089073e"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p1.titulo:3w2ux0iv4aazc", "value": "Aplique umas gotas", "translatableContentDigest": "360916496b8de32704d791aa905d7be66e65b27170d62c6ff43065a33089073e"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p1.texto:xz1qb5gr545x", "value": "Avec le compte-gouttes, répartissez quelques gouttes sur le cuir chevelu et les cheveux, avant le shampooing.", "translatableContentDigest": "b587e50db4ce02c0bb4a957bb83360ae4ca199fcb2f2d4ca2b9c32ae5344a0d8"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p1.texto:xz1qb5gr545x", "value": "Com o conta-gotas, distribua umas gotas pelo couro cabeludo e pelo cabelo, antes de o lavar.", "translatableContentDigest": "b587e50db4ce02c0bb4a957bb83360ae4ca199fcb2f2d4ca2b9c32ae5344a0d8"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p1.tiempo:3w2ux0ilta5d9", "value": "Sans gaspiller : flacon de 30 ml", "translatableContentDigest": "2c4763e629f52231f60cdd6e65fd0fc1c1d2739b2e4d7019baff284de31cfaef"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p1.tiempo:3w2ux0ilta5d9", "value": "Sem desperdício: frasco de 30 ml", "translatableContentDigest": "2c4763e629f52231f60cdd6e65fd0fc1c1d2739b2e4d7019baff284de31cfaef"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p2.titulo:1vq6b02zejd97", "value": "Massez délicatement", "translatableContentDigest": "38824d6dbb1af81b85cd9bf1e47d75d66a5ebb45aa46e77faab56584d4e9f559"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p2.titulo:1vq6b02zejd97", "value": "Massaje suavemente", "translatableContentDigest": "38824d6dbb1af81b85cd9bf1e47d75d66a5ebb45aa46e77faab56584d4e9f559"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p2.texto:j1g2n1iibr7a", "value": "Du bout des doigts, par mouvements circulaires. Vous sentirez la fraîcheur de la menthe.", "translatableContentDigest": "5f4bc39246d8905c3f61c401f5582e85494230b6a86632cef8d173041cd323d9"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p2.texto:j1g2n1iibr7a", "value": "Com as pontas dos dedos, em movimentos circulares. Vai notar a frescura da hortelã-pimenta.", "translatableContentDigest": "5f4bc39246d8905c3f61c401f5582e85494230b6a86632cef8d173041cd323d9"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p2.tiempo:1vq6b02osup7y", "value": "Votre moment pour vous", "translatableContentDigest": "3945fc917656c33aea864ec5594d5cc0a42ea24815c4c3402c9d6e9a62207136"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p2.tiempo:1vq6b02osup7y", "value": "O seu momento de autocuidado", "translatableContentDigest": "3945fc917656c33aea864ec5594d5cc0a42ea24815c4c3402c9d6e9a62207136"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p3.titulo:3oa70w8gzji8q", "value": "Laissez agir puis lavez", "translatableContentDigest": "b5818bf712d182bade54aadb459cccd24f03d5cdf2ffc5e011cb1a10c006ab33"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p3.titulo:3oa70w8gzji8q", "value": "Deixe atuar e lave", "translatableContentDigest": "b5818bf712d182bade54aadb459cccd24f03d5cdf2ffc5e011cb1a10c006ab33"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p3.texto:2gy4cnftnffdj", "value": "Laissez agir au moins 15 minutes, puis lavez vos cheveux comme d'habitude. À répéter 1 à 2 fois par semaine.", "translatableContentDigest": "b56456f2a738eb0d2f313b525007bf0bb23b29957ea72fdd78c8904e26d31252"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p3.texto:2gy4cnftnffdj", "value": "Deixe atuar pelo menos 15 minutos e depois lave o cabelo como de costume. Repita 1–2 vezes por semana.", "translatableContentDigest": "b56456f2a738eb0d2f313b525007bf0bb23b29957ea72fdd78c8904e26d31252"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p3.tiempo:3oa70w87u0jan", "value": "15 minutes minimum", "translatableContentDigest": "91348f2f140f93c808401fe274f3e4fc2383686518e8b4a92199629db4911dfd"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.pasos.p3.tiempo:3oa70w87u0jan", "value": "Mínimo 15 minutos", "translatableContentDigest": "91348f2f140f93c808401fe274f3e4fc2383686518e8b4a92199629db4911dfd"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ritual.flotante_num:lajmyvq9vavm", "value": "1–2", "translatableContentDigest": "d1552596b1c462764a3f0be84cbfd5a6e42cca1b19e6f1764f1faf5dde83a8bb"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ritual.flotante_num:lajmyvq9vavm", "value": "1–2", "translatableContentDigest": "d1552596b1c462764a3f0be84cbfd5a6e42cca1b19e6f1764f1faf5dde83a8bb"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ritual.flotante_texto:1rar3aupm47km", "value": "fois par semaine. La régularité est le secret.", "translatableContentDigest": "24f932870db764057e45ae98537e0a58337f6c226d7ff78a9de32e31956c02ae"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ritual.flotante_texto:1rar3aupm47km", "value": "vezes por semana. A constância é o segredo.", "translatableContentDigest": "24f932870db764057e45ae98537e0a58337f6c226d7ff78a9de32e31956c02ae"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ritual.eyebrow:g0dvhrg6lehx", "value": "Rituel du soir", "translatableContentDigest": "d7705ad1891bc532aedb40b37cf36beb543c4f75f04fbc3208ae19508dd0d39d"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ritual.eyebrow:g0dvhrg6lehx", "value": "Ritual da noite", "translatableContentDigest": "d7705ad1891bc532aedb40b37cf36beb543c4f75f04fbc3208ae19508dd0d39d"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ritual.titulo:3jw6mu1tkwp7v", "value": "Un petit geste qui devient une <em>habitude</em>", "translatableContentDigest": "c7dfd6ac36aeeb76f0d608a86269229fa832d1e1fddf12df390ea20d9ae2e444"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ritual.titulo:3jw6mu1tkwp7v", "value": "Um pequeno gesto que se torna um <em>hábito</em>", "translatableContentDigest": "c7dfd6ac36aeeb76f0d608a86269229fa832d1e1fddf12df390ea20d9ae2e444"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ritual.texto:1n33jn5cd44jq", "value": "Allumez une bougie, installez-vous confortablement et offrez-vous quinze minutes. Rizelune transforme un geste aussi simple que votre shampooing en un petit rituel de soin.", "translatableContentDigest": "0ac43e63979e299c6dba6b0a2f5d298647d3b187e7daabdac4a101eef1ecc9f2"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ritual.texto:1n33jn5cd44jq", "value": "Acenda uma vela, fique confortável e ofereça a si mesma quinze minutos. O Rizelune transforma algo tão simples como lavar o cabelo num pequeno ritual de cuidado.", "translatableContentDigest": "0ac43e63979e299c6dba6b0a2f5d298647d3b187e7daabdac4a101eef1ecc9f2"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ritual.lista:1n33jmrcb0713", "value": "Cuir chevelu nourri et sensation de fraîcheur\nDes cheveux plus forts dès la racine\nUn éclat sain qui se voit", "translatableContentDigest": "12e1dc84a35e5e6809f6d44c13058253c571b9a67179fcf9524ca9503ae20464"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ritual.lista:1n33jmrcb0713", "value": "Couro cabeludo nutrido e com sensação de frescura\nCabelo com mais força desde a raiz\nUm brilho saudável que se nota", "translatableContentDigest": "12e1dc84a35e5e6809f6d44c13058253c571b9a67179fcf9524ca9503ae20464"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.resenas.eyebrow:ajs4bx2b6wzz", "value": "Avis", "translatableContentDigest": "55922468babb8b370310870a838a54734b14ac439b211573aa5b3396fa5c9274"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.resenas.eyebrow:ajs4bx2b6wzz", "value": "Opiniões", "translatableContentDigest": "55922468babb8b370310870a838a54734b14ac439b211573aa5b3396fa5c9274"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.resenas.titulo:3b8g1849vmarl", "value": "Ce qu'en disent celles qui ont déjà leur <em>rituel</em>", "translatableContentDigest": "fa1d06afd7577a699637f2d02fd2531a309334d9ab1632e9aecfe86233265508"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.resenas.titulo:3b8g1849vmarl", "value": "O que dizem as clientes que já têm o seu <em>ritual</em>", "translatableContentDigest": "fa1d06afd7577a699637f2d02fd2531a309334d9ab1632e9aecfe86233265508"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.eyebrow:1u80yinqsnq90", "value": "Questions", "translatableContentDigest": "4b9a4c9ba82557a102268f75382ce489e0115d8313326923a51485c16bac82d4"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.eyebrow:1u80yinqsnq90", "value": "Dúvidas", "translatableContentDigest": "4b9a4c9ba82557a102268f75382ce489e0115d8313326923a51485c16bac82d4"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.titulo:1xyhqvxqmlsui", "value": "Questions <em>fréquentes</em>", "translatableContentDigest": "4c87fb056a7cb3c40a13c9239295eef5895d0baa245836af3866f9a7154f5a72"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.titulo:1xyhqvxqmlsui", "value": "Perguntas <em>frequentes</em>", "translatableContentDigest": "4c87fb056a7cb3c40a13c9239295eef5895d0baa245836af3866f9a7154f5a72"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f1.pregunta:3v70crvswyxrr", "value": "Comment utiliser Rizelune ?", "translatableContentDigest": "58a5a1a49092bfe90870d621b89aedfe457be7f5c959e031a82512c564445523"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f1.pregunta:3v70crvswyxrr", "value": "Como se usa o Rizelune?", "translatableContentDigest": "58a5a1a49092bfe90870d621b89aedfe457be7f5c959e031a82512c564445523"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f1.respuesta:30nurg9dt1tp7", "value": "<p>Appliquez quelques gouttes sur le cuir chevelu et les cheveux, massez du bout des doigts et laissez agir au moins 15 minutes. Lavez ensuite vos cheveux comme d'habitude.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "c0f3c2e81bca4aba76b81335ddcc6bbcdb95e4d8ff9c02f9a9a49c57ad6e746d"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f1.respuesta:30nurg9dt1tp7", "value": "<p>Aplique umas gotas no couro cabeludo e no cabelo, massaje com as pontas dos dedos e deixe atuar pelo menos 15 minutos. Depois lave o cabelo como de costume.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "c0f3c2e81bca4aba76b81335ddcc6bbcdb95e4d8ff9c02f9a9a49c57ad6e746d"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f2.pregunta:xwb2pewbu2ic", "value": "À quelle fréquence l'appliquer ?", "translatableContentDigest": "1a2b83d96cdc0cb0b17222e406ba71e4119fcdba775192cd763e40a91db69aa9"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f2.pregunta:xwb2pewbu2ic", "value": "Com que frequência devo aplicar?", "translatableContentDigest": "1a2b83d96cdc0cb0b17222e406ba71e4119fcdba775192cd763e40a91db69aa9"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f2.respuesta:3tjq2c18cnnnc", "value": "<p>Nous recommandons de l'utiliser 1 à 2 fois par semaine. C'est la régularité qui fait la différence.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "a6870d37fb9260d6506aea21d9f01d3f95cb537bce7d607d07aebcacd9f8c520"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f2.respuesta:3tjq2c18cnnnc", "value": "<p>Recomendamos usá-lo 1–2 vezes por semana. A constância é o que faz a diferença.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "a6870d37fb9260d6506aea21d9f01d3f95cb537bce7d607d07aebcacd9f8c520"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f3.pregunta:3t885ss6queet", "value": "Va-t-il graisser mes cheveux ?", "translatableContentDigest": "87b83cb6a3cbd70c5efa2b67ef517da4f63187bcfba4ba60998f8cc542d7a414"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f3.pregunta:3t885ss6queet", "value": "Vai deixar o cabelo oleoso?", "translatableContentDigest": "87b83cb6a3cbd70c5efa2b67ef517da4f63187bcfba4ba60998f8cc542d7a414"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f3.respuesta:17tmt0mazwpqx", "value": "<p>Non, car il s'applique <strong>avant</strong> le shampooing. Après l'avoir laissé agir, vous lavez vos cheveux comme d'habitude et il s'élimine.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "3fe6571811042e2efb1dcfc420dd448bb865c1c7bd16c4e9196bb44b9669b5f2"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f3.respuesta:17tmt0mazwpqx", "value": "<p>Não, porque se aplica <strong>antes</strong> da lavagem. Depois de o deixar atuar, lava o cabelo como sempre e sai.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "3fe6571811042e2efb1dcfc420dd448bb865c1c7bd16c4e9196bb44b9669b5f2"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f4.pregunta:3klchfeqdxhde", "value": "Est-il vegan ?", "translatableContentDigest": "3be62f76245aa20574f3d452de14364c9a8c1b6065b9e400f7b74e23b1aa348e"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f4.pregunta:3klchfeqdxhde", "value": "É vegano?", "translatableContentDigest": "3be62f76245aa20574f3d452de14364c9a8c1b6065b9e400f7b74e23b1aa348e"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f4.respuesta:130j0hdevf7em", "value": "<p>Oui. Sa formule est naturelle et vegan, fabriquée dans l'UE avec certification qualité.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "4aec1c6e188fe1d90698ffc30316fce480b4d44eeed63e7bdef153154eed2e1c"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f4.respuesta:130j0hdevf7em", "value": "<p>Sim. A sua fórmula é natural e vegana, fabricada na UE com certificação de qualidade.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "4aec1c6e188fe1d90698ffc30316fce480b4d44eeed63e7bdef153154eed2e1c"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f5.pregunta:2jrvjhpuo5chf", "value": "Quelle est la taille du flacon ?", "translatableContentDigest": "9218e0a8350704b610dfe486d54a5b4bc35def5e526102a3a37983dc22fc6331"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f5.pregunta:2jrvjhpuo5chf", "value": "Qual é o tamanho do frasco?", "translatableContentDigest": "9218e0a8350704b610dfe486d54a5b4bc35def5e526102a3a37983dc22fc6331"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f5.respuesta:2dfts70nngqan", "value": "<p>30 ml, avec compte-gouttes pour doser juste ce qu'il faut, sans gaspiller.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "8adcbade9d406c868ce772e46f82056620c4a046e1f468f0113de1e64fd6a6c2"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f5.respuesta:2dfts70nngqan", "value": "<p>30 ml, com conta-gotas para dosear apenas o que precisa, sem desperdício.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "8adcbade9d406c868ce772e46f82056620c4a046e1f468f0113de1e64fd6a6c2"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f6.pregunta:3imkagb47sy0g", "value": "Quelle est son odeur ?", "translatableContentDigest": "b0681211024033207afa0f45d9d920ba9448f04adc631143205d9ca9da430b1e"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f6.pregunta:3imkagb47sy0g", "value": "A que cheira?", "translatableContentDigest": "b0681211024033207afa0f45d9d920ba9448f04adc631143205d9ca9da430b1e"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f6.respuesta:36bp32si72k8s", "value": "<p>Le romarin et la menthe : un parfum herbacé et frais, avec une touche de fraîcheur sur le cuir chevelu grâce à la menthe.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "d4952b60ee498b6ade478e7c38ef9428e13f6d466f9bd08522c7b17fb802de22"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f6.respuesta:36bp32si72k8s", "value": "<p>Cheira a alecrim e hortelã-pimenta: um aroma herbal e fresco, com um toque de frescura no couro cabeludo graças à hortelã-pimenta.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "d4952b60ee498b6ade478e7c38ef9428e13f6d466f9bd08522c7b17fb802de22"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f7.pregunta:2ht3cim8i0t4h", "value": "Combien coûte la livraison et quel est le délai ?", "translatableContentDigest": "57069fcbf1a723a7ecb430d326df3942dbf097c8f9e3eaea360c8da76afe32c4"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f7.pregunta:2ht3cim8i0t4h", "value": "Quanto custa o envio e quanto tempo demora?", "translatableContentDigest": "57069fcbf1a723a7ecb430d326df3942dbf097c8f9e3eaea360c8da76afe32c4"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f7.respuesta:klltrdkubmcd", "value": "<p><strong>France et Portugal :</strong> 6 € (ou seulement 2,99 € dès 39,99 € d'achat). Livraison en 8 jours ouvrés environ en France et 11 au Portugal.</p><p><strong>Espagne :</strong> livraison <strong>gratuite</strong> dès 39,99 € (sinon 6,99 €), en 10 jours ouvrés environ.</p><p>Vous recevrez un e-mail avec le numéro de suivi. Plus d'informations dans notre <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">politique de livraison</a>.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "c032682077894683fb524ed9f5c5589c095e9fe2623c3c29c50ae1dd2c029c3f"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f7.respuesta:klltrdkubmcd", "value": "<p><strong>Portugal e França:</strong> 6 € (ou apenas 2,99 € a partir de 39,99 €). Chega em cerca de 11 dias úteis a Portugal e 8 a França.</p><p><strong>Espanha:</strong> envio <strong>grátis</strong> a partir de 39,99 € (caso contrário, 6,99 €), em cerca de 10 dias úteis.</p><p>Receberá um e-mail com o número de seguimento. Mais informações na nossa <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">política de envio</a>.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "c032682077894683fb524ed9f5c5589c095e9fe2623c3c29c50ae1dd2c029c3f"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f8.pregunta:31jt148w2ljjy", "value": "Puis-je le retourner ?", "translatableContentDigest": "122be472b5deda3ddbdaf661eca8ce2b508245a28cad5f5260cfdcdbc1326aa3"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f8.pregunta:31jt148w2ljjy", "value": "Posso devolvê-lo?", "translatableContentDigest": "122be472b5deda3ddbdaf661eca8ce2b508245a28cad5f5260cfdcdbc1326aa3"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f8.respuesta:33cjnnrz1e5ki", "value": "<p>Oui. Vous disposez de 14 jours à compter de la réception pour demander un retour. Consultez toutes les conditions dans notre <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">politique de retour</a>.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "ce7809b9773fcc8740f2e2ba28601780dc8fd4d0d8560122f4462b70f9def585"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f8.respuesta:33cjnnrz1e5ki", "value": "<p>Sim. Tem 14 dias desde que o recebe para solicitar a devolução. Consulte todas as condições na nossa <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">política de devoluções</a>.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "ce7809b9773fcc8740f2e2ba28601780dc8fd4d0d8560122f4462b70f9def585"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.garantias.g1.titulo:1sphby1w0hv0l", "value": "Paiement sécurisé", "translatableContentDigest": "1e412eca43f5141d1783f468f757fc158f8a0b4fc6c32022582aef00c9d5f853"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.garantias.g1.titulo:1sphby1w0hv0l", "value": "Pagamento seguro", "translatableContentDigest": "1e412eca43f5141d1783f468f757fc158f8a0b4fc6c32022582aef00c9d5f853"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.garantias.g1.texto:1xwu8hwocchew", "value": "Vos données toujours protégées", "translatableContentDigest": "ec45d91f5d58cf242e5486c30074a8115059dedb73a9d9dd44033fa4f6012bc7"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.garantias.g1.texto:1xwu8hwocchew", "value": "Os seus dados sempre protegidos", "translatableContentDigest": "ec45d91f5d58cf242e5486c30074a8115059dedb73a9d9dd44033fa4f6012bc7"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.garantias.g2.titulo:fenh1m9gjjie", "value": "Cosmétique naturelle", "translatableContentDigest": "1c2865a13ada5e626dcef76f9fd80759a566ac94bebb102d1260f9ee9c137b7b"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.garanti